ives that (1) Congress should adopt a fiscal target to reduce the federal budget deficit to 3% of gross domestic product or less as soon as possible and no later than the end of FY2030; and (2) after the target is achieved, Congress should continue to pursue further deficit reduction with the goal of achieving a balanced federal budget.</p>","updateDate":"2026-02-06T19:53:35Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Expressing the sense of the House of Representatives that the United States should reduce and maintain the Federal unified budget deficit at or below 3 percent of gross domestic product.","type":"hres","updateDate":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z"}
